      "description": "Original synthetic images and projects by OpenCVDataflowGUI contributors, MIT. No customer images. Run all acquires 3 pages with filename/page tickets: 72x48 uint8 gray, 64x40 uint16 BGR and 56x32 float64 BGRA with signed HDR values. Typed Encoded preserves page labels, tickets and coordinate payloads; raw Buffer contains TIFF pixels only and the decoder creates new page frames. Selected pages uses stride 2: indexes 0 and 2, preview 1 is original page 2. Verification requires zero sample difference. Unbatch emits each selected image in order. Pixel budget guard intentionally rejects before pixel decoding; Predictor guard intentionally rejects horizontal prediction on floating pages. No files are written.",
